<title>USA: Warner-Lambert declines comment on Sanofi.</title>
<headline>Warner-Lambert declines comment on Sanofi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner-Lambert Inc declined comment on speculation that its Parke-Davis subsidiary and Sanofi were about to announce an alliance.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not comment on speculation or rumors,&quot; said a Warner-Lambert spokesman.</p>
<p>He noted that the two companies have had a long-standing co-marketing agreement for Warner-Lambert's Accupril drug for congestive heart failure and hypertension.</p>
